---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config.ts';
---
<Legal title="Privacy policy" tab="privacy" path="/legal/privacy">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>If you create an account in the desk, we collect your email address and the data you choose to save — such as a watchlist, private notes, or manually entered portfolio holdings. If you contact us, we keep that correspondence.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>To operate the product, to let you back into your account, and to send you the updates you asked for. We do not sell your data.</p>

  <h2>Who processes it</h2>
  <p>We use third-party infrastructure to run the service — currently our authentication and database provider, and our hosting provider. The full list and their roles will be finalised here.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can unsubscribe from email at any time, and you can ask us to delete your account data. The complete set of rights and retention periods will be finalised here.</p>
</Legal>
